  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 896054,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "@a3z4km3 reported an unsafe nginx regex pattern in docker-jitsi-meet's `/colibri-relay-ws/` location. When `ENABLE_OCTO` was enabled, the regex `[a-zA-Z0-9-\\._]+` accepted arbitrary domain names and IP addresses for proxy_pass directives,  allowing unauthenticated requests to be proxied to attacker-specified destinations.\n\nThe vulnerable nginx location and associated relay WebSocket proxy configuration have been removed.\n\n**Changes:**\n* feat(web,jvb): remove deprecated colibri websocket support\n  * https://github.com/jitsi/docker-jitsi-meet/pull/2285\n\nWe thank @a3z4km3 for submitting this report to us.",
